# The in-session surface. Absent from `codex --help`, like Claude's — which is
# why the two views never merge.
name:    codex
what:    OpenAI Codex CLI, from the inside
check:   codex
docs:    / inside a session lists its own commands as you type

= WHILE YOU ARE IN IT
Esc              | interrupt what it is doing
Ctrl-c           | cancel the current input
Ctrl-d           | leave the session
/                | its own commands, listed as you type

= THINGS THAT LOOK LIKE ERRORS AND ARE NOT
Model metadata for `NAME` not found | a combo name is not a model id codex has
                                    | metadata for. Cosmetic; it still routes
